    "idea": "Locomotive Cab boss showdown against The Engineer: dodge Coal-Shovel Spreads, Brake-Lurches, and Whistle Steam Lanes in P1; survive the dramatic P2 roof blow-off layer swap & Parallel Rail-Drone; snap his P3 twin Boiler Pressure Chains to claim Half-Lantern #1 and Pane Cinder Blast!",
